find herself back in the recital hall, the audience's applause arriving a half-second after she expected it, as though she had briefly forgotten they were there to hear anything at all.\n\nHer teacher, waiting in the wings, said only \"the middle section,\" with an expression Freya couldn't immediately place, and it took her a moment to realise it was pride, worn slightly awkwardly, like a coat that didn't quite fit but was worn anyway because the weather demanded it.","quotationRequired":["The tentative quality fell away"],"validationTier":"TIER3_QUOTATION_PLUS_EXPLANATION"}$json$,
